            <div class="site-container about-grid"><div class="about-monogram" aria-hidden="true"><span>dz<span>.</span></span><div>PRODUCT × ENGINEERING × BUSINESS</div></div><div><p class="section-kicker">YOUR PARTNER</p><h2>A builder who sees<br />the whole business</h2><p class="about-intro">I’m Daniel Zuloaga. Engineer, product lead, MBA. I’ve spent twenty years building software and working with the people who depend on it.</p><p>That work has taught me to look beyond the software itself. A solution has to make sense for the business, fit how the team works, and be worth the time and money it takes to build.</p><p>Most recently, I’ve been shipping AI in regulated finance, helping teams review documents, find information, and spend less time on repetitive tasks. Accuracy matters there, and people need to trust a system before they’ll use it.</p><p>At Zulo, you work directly with me. We figure out where AI could be useful in your business, build around your constraints, and help your team get comfortable using it.</p><a class="text-action" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/daniel-zuloaga/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meet Daniel on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></div>
